<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">YOUR OWN RESPONSE</view><view class="title">{{questionnaire.title}}</view><view class="desc">请选择最符合自己最近情况的答案。</view>
<view class="card" wx:for="{{questionnaire.questions}}" wx:key="id"><view class="card-title">{{index+1}}. {{item.text}}</view><view wx:for="{{item.options}}" wx:for-item="choice" wx:key="value" class="choice {{answers[item.id]===choice.value?'active':''}}" data-qid="{{item.id}}" data-value="{{choice.value}}" bindtap="selectOption"><view style="width:30rpx;height:30rpx;border-radius:50%;border:3rpx solid #56907b;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><view wx:if="{{answers[item.id]===choice.value}}" style="width:16rpx;height:16rpx;background:#176956;border-radius:50%"></view></view>{{choice.label}}</view></view>
<button class="btn primary" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="submit">提交我的回答</button><view class="notice">问卷仅反映自我感受，不构成心理疾病筛查结果或诊断。如感到长期痛苦或无法应对，建议寻求有资质的专业人员支持。</view></view>
